/* Pardon the Apocalypse · living poster (living board module, contract v1)
   Night on Carmody Street. Kindly's glossy pink smiley is the only light; Wren, on the corner, lobs one of
   Dolly's brown eggs at it. Made from the game: Wren's pixels are the game's own personFrame('wren', pose)
   lit by the poster's pbLit pass, baked as run-length rows; the houses are the game's Carmody Street painting
   (areaCanvas('street','night')) baked as pbNightPaint's tone per pixel and dithered here; Kindly's smiley,
   glow and the Glyde scooter are the game's own gloss code (02b_gloss.js, 04b_enemies.js) ported as is.
   The scooter's crack and freed pixels are the game's crackGloss output, baked. See README.md. */
